{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself trapped in a dying world fractured into three different biomes. You must fight not only to survive, but to uncover the hidden stories left behind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Frozen wastelands and pitch-black forests to sandworm-infested dunes\u2014each biome is alive, hostile and watching you all along.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Something Is Hunting you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters chase and stalk you without rest. They listen. They adapt. And they remember. The deeper you explore, the more you start becoming prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746230/extras/b2f06b826086e683c6517655a09530a3.avif?t=1765616790\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746230/extras_big/b2f06b826086e683c6517655a09530a3.avif?t=1765616790 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Key features</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0e Navigate three unique biomes, each with shifting weather, hostile creatures and layered mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0e Adapt to pitch-black forests, blinding sandstorms and other punishing conditions that might affect you visibility and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless AI Threats</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0e Face creatures that don't follow scripts. They track, stalk and ambush. There is no &quot;safe zone&quot; out in the wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0e Sound cues, light and movement matter. Silence is your greatest weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-driven Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0e Uncover fragments of a forgotten past through environmental storytelling, hidden signs and mysterious hints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0e Multiple layers of lore and experiences encourage replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746230/extras/d70ebfe5b4b9939df8c53950e7e32846.avif?t=1765616790\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746230/extras_big/d70ebfe5b4b9939df8c53950e7e32846.avif?t=1765616790 width=800 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal UI. Maximum Tension</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0e No objective markers. No hand-holding. All you have is what you find and your own intuition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0e Immersion-focused design ensures you're always in the world, not above it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror That Evolves</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0e The more you survive, the worse it gets. Unpredictable enemy behaviour and quick environmental changes keep you guessing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Join The Community</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0e Wishlist now to stay updated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0e Follow development updates and lore drops on [Twitter / Discord / Youtube / Tiktok]</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3746230?t=1765616790","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746230/ca156f1c4c4b3e6f5076f43c4a33e034cc9e41ce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765616790","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746230/b6fe8e2b217e39cee184eaf7049ca5cb3694f486/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765616790","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746230/b6fe8e2b217e39cee184eaf7049ca5cb3694f486/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765616790","categories":[